{"id":"8380a071500296f8","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-path-nl-complete.md","title":"PATH is NL-Complete","display":"thm-path-nl-complete — PATH is NL-Complete","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-path-nl-complete","aliases":["28-thm-path-nl-complete","ST-CONNECTIVITY is NL-Complete"],"display":"thm-path-nl-complete — PATH is NL-Complete","depends_on":["[[28-df-path]]","[[28-df-nl]]","[[28-df-logspace-reduction]]","[[28-df-configuration-graph]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-path-nl-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-path-nl-complete</span><span>ST-CONNECTIVITY is NL-Complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-path-nl-complete — PATH is NL-Complete"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"45e118fdc159a03d\" href=\"?note=45e118fdc159a03d\" title=\"28-df-path\">28-df-path</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ba1abccdb0412836\" href=\"?note=ba1abccdb0412836\" title=\"28-df-nl\">28-df-nl</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a91903f455f49892\" href=\"?note=a91903f455f49892\" title=\"28-df-logspace-reduction\">28-df-logspace-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1b4d0bd43db4c9c9\" href=\"?note=1b4d0bd43db4c9c9\" title=\"28-df-configuration-graph\">28-df-configuration-graph</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PATH}\">\\(\\mathrm{PATH}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NL}\">\\(\\mathbf{NL}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}\">\\(\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"45e118fdc159a03d\" href=\"?note=45e118fdc159a03d\" title=\"28-df-path\">28-df-path</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ba1abccdb0412836\" href=\"?note=ba1abccdb0412836\" title=\"28-df-nl\">28-df-nl</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a91903f455f49892\" href=\"?note=a91903f455f49892\" title=\"28-df-logspace-reduction\">28-df-logspace-reduction</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PATH}\\in\\mathbf{NL}\\land\\forall L\\in\\mathbf{NL}\\;L\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}\\mathrm{PATH}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PATH}\\in\\mathbf{NL}\\land\\forall L\\in\\mathbf{NL}\\;L\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}\\mathrm{PATH}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>成员资格：猜测从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 起的至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|V|-1\">\\(|V|-1\\)</span> 步路径，只保存当前顶点和步数，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=t\">\\(s=t\\)</span> 立即接受。难性：把固定 NL 机器在给定输入上的所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(\\log n)\">\\(O(\\log n)\\)</span> 比特配置作为多项式数量的图顶点，逐位输出邻接矩阵；两个配置是否一步相连可在对数空间内检查。可把全部接受配置接到一个新目标顶点，避免假设原机器本来只有一个接受配置。隐式输出定义同时要求长度谓词和位值谓词，见归约原子。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理4.18及证明；印刷89页；PDF115页。成员资格参见印刷82页/PDF108页；证明结构已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-path","status":"resolved","id":"45e118fdc159a03d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-path]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-nl","status":"resolved","id":"ba1abccdb0412836","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-nl]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-logspace-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"a91903f455f49892","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-logspace-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration-graph","status":"resolved","id":"1b4d0bd43db4c9c9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-configuration-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-path","status":"resolved","id":"45e118fdc159a03d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PATH}$、$\\mathbf{NL}$、$\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}$ 分别见 [[28-df-path]]、[[28-df-nl]]、[[28-df-logspace-reduction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-nl","status":"resolved","id":"ba1abccdb0412836","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PATH}$、$\\mathbf{NL}$、$\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}$ 分别见 [[28-df-path]]、[[28-df-nl]]、[[28-df-logspace-reduction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-logspace-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"a91903f455f49892","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PATH}$、$\\mathbf{NL}$、$\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}$ 分别见 [[28-df-path]]、[[28-df-nl]]、[[28-df-logspace-reduction]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PATH}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PATH}\\in\\mathbf{NL}\\land\\forall L\\in\\mathbf{NL}\\;L\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}\\mathrm{PATH}.","display":true},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"|V|-1","display":false},{"tex":"s=t","display":false},{"tex":"O(\\log n)","display":false}],"bytes":1362,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"空间完全问题：[[28-df-path]]、[[28-thm-path-nl-complete]]、[[28-df-tqbf]]、[[28-thm-tqbf-pspace-complete]]。"}],"outgoing":["45e118fdc159a03d","ba1abccdb0412836","a91903f45